{"reference":"2 Samuel 6","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":6,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"chapter_overview","title":"Overview","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The chapter presents the ark’s journey to Jerusalem in two sharply contrasted stages. David gathers Israel to bring it to the city, but the first attempt ends in Uzzah’s death and a three-month delay. Only afterward does David bring the ark into Jerusalem with sacrifice, music, and public celebration. The movement makes the ark’s arrival part of David’s establishment of Jerusalem as his royal center, while preserving the disruption and fear that preceded it.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 6:1-23"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_006_746f92906bab7ab97588dc67"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Wider Setting","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"In the surrounding account of David’s kingdom, archaeology supports the existence of a later Davidic dynasty, but the size, administration, and chronology of David’s own kingdom remain disputed. This chapter should therefore be read as the narrative’s presentation of David’s rule without treating it as proof of one uncontested historical reconstruction.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 5","2 Samuel 7:1-29","2 Samuel 8:1-18"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_006_703b762b790953f5f384dd76"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"},{"id":"block_3","text":"Within the larger movement of 2 Samuel, this chapter belongs to the early account of David’s accession and consolidation of his kingdom. The book then moves through the ark and the promise concerning David’s dynasty before turning to royal abuse, household violence, rebellion, grief, and its closing appendix. That larger shape gives this moment of celebration a place within a story that does not portray David’s reign as uniformly triumphant.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 1","2 Samuel 10:1-19","2 Samuel 11:1-27","2 Samuel 12:1-31","2 Samuel 13:1-39","2 Samuel 14:1-33","2 Samuel 15:1-37","2 Samuel 16:1-23","2 Samuel 17:1-29","2 Samuel 18:1-33","2 Samuel 19:1-43","2 Samuel 20:1-26","2 Samuel 21:1-22","2 Samuel 22:1-51","2 Samuel 23:1-39","2 Samuel 24:1-25","2 Samuel 2:1-32","2 Samuel 3:1-39","2 Samuel 4:1-12","2 Samuel 5:1-25","2 Samuel 7:1-29","2 Samuel 8:1-18","2 Samuel 9:1-13"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_006_fddb38057eaaf948dbe4d413"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}